        <p><seg source="#source-12133-12139">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12139-12160"><rb>今度</rb><rt>こんど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12160-12163">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12163-12178"><rb>旅</rb><rt>たび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12178-12181">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12181-12196"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12196-12208">にも……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12208-12226"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12226-12235">たちに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12235-12259"><rb>真面目</rb><rt>まじめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12259-12262">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12262-12274"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12274-12285">つた。</seg></p>
