        <p><seg source="#source-24505-24508">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24508-24523"><rb>留</rb><rt>とま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24523-24532">つては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24532-24544"><rb>居</rb><rt>を</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24544-24574">らんなあ。はてなあ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24574-24586"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24586-24589">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24589-24610"><rb>汽車</rb><rt>きしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24610-24619">は十二</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24619-24634"><rb>時</rb><rt>じ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24634-24643">二十四</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24643-24661"><rb>分</rb><rt>ふん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24661-24667">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24667-24685"><rb>漸</rb><rt>やうや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24685-24688">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24688-24712"><rb>白河</rb><rt>しらかは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24712-24715">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24715-24727"><rb>着</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby>きをるですがな。」</p>
